ormats\n* 2e930f3 feat: persist per-table column visibility\n* 0e0a8f4 fix: correct tree search matching and navigation\n* 334a23b fix: don't write merged global config into the local .lazysql.toml\n* b4eb6b8 fix: make column modal opaque and simplify its footer\n* 3c27ed3 fix: make editor query routing quote and comment aware\n* 14a1b4b fix: preserve env templates when saving connections\n* 590377e fix: respect SQL dialects when routing editor results\n* 51d5225 fix: show rows for editor queries that return a result set\n\n"}
